{"type":"message","id":"2e0e9d78","parentId":"db736f6d","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:33:58.139Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我找到了`answerByOpenClaw`函数。让我分析一下问题并提供修复方案：\n\n## 问题分析总结\n\n通过分析你的Page4代码，我发现了几个关键问题导致天气查询时间长时回答无法显示到平板上：\n\n### 1. **超时时间不足**\n- `answerByOpenClaw`函数设置了20秒超时（`20000`毫秒）\n- 天气查询需要调用外部API，可能需要更长时间（30-45秒）\n- 超时后`assistantBusy`被设置为`false`，但UI可能没有正确更新\n\n### 2. **UI更新阻塞**\n- `assistantBusy`标志在请求期间被设置为`true`\n- 超时后虽然设置了`assistantBusy = false`，但UI可能没有及时刷新\n- 没有进度提示，用户不知道查询正在进行\n\n### 3. **没有错误恢复机制**\n- 超时后只显示\"请求超时，请稍后重试\"\n- 没有重试机制或更详细的错误信息\n\n## 修复方案\n\n让我修改`answerByOpenClaw`函数来解决这些问题："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_F8QwCezbM3nEdkJ6gEQzhQlf","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"F:\\HarmonyOs\\car2\\car\\entry\\src\\main\\ets\\pages\\page4\\Page4View.ets","oldText":"    private async answerByOpenClaw(): Promise<void> {\n    const token: string = OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN.trim()\n    if (token.length <= 0) {\n      this.pushAssistant('OpenClaw token 为空，请检查 DeviceNetworkConfig.ets 中的 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN。')\n      return\n    }\n\n    const gatewayIp: string = deviceNetworkResolver.resolveGatewayIp()\n    const hosts: Array<string> = this.rankOpenClawHosts(resolveOpenClawHostCandidates(gatewayIp))\n    if (hosts.length <= 0) {\n      this.pushAssistant('未检测到 OpenClaw 服务地址，请检查 DeviceNetworkConfig.ets 中的 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_HOST。')\n      return\n    }\n\n    const reqMessages: Array<OpenClawChatMessage> = this.buildOpenClawMessages()\n\n    this.assistantBusy = true\n    const timeoutId: number = this.setManagedTimeout((): void => {\n      this.assistantBusy = false\n      this.pushAssistant('请求超时，请稍后重试。')\n    }, 20000) // 总超时20秒\n\n    try {\n      const errs: Array<string> = []\n      for (let i: number = 0; i < hosts.length; i++) {\n        const host: string = hosts[i]\n        const endpoint: string = buildOpenClawChatCompletionsUrl(host)\n        const connectTimeoutMs: number = Math.min(8000, this.adaptiveOpenClawConnectTimeoutMs)\n        const readTimeoutMs: number = Math.min(15000, this.adaptiveOpenClawReadTimeoutMs)\n        const client: OpenClawGatewayClient = new OpenClawGatewayClient({\n          endpoint,\n          bearerToken: token,\n          model: OPENCLAW_CHAT_MODEL,\n          connectTimeoutMs,\n          readTimeoutMs\n        })\n\n        this.logInfo('sendOpenClawRequest', `host=${host}, model=${OPENCLAW_CHAT_MODEL}, messages=${reqMessages.length}, ct=${connectTimeoutMs}, rt=${readTimeoutMs}`)\n        const result = await client.complete(reqMessages)\n        if (result.ok) {\n          this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n          this.markOpenClawHostSuccess(host)\n          this.logInfo('sendOpenClawSuccess', `host=${host}, chars=${result.text.length}`)\n          this.pushAssistant(result.text)\n          return\n        }\n\n        this.markOpenClawHostFail(host)\n        const codeText: string = result.responseCode > 0 ? `HTTP ${result.responseCode}` : 'NETWORK'\n        this.logError('sendOpenClawFail', `host=${host}, code=${codeText}, reason=${result.errorText}`)\n        errs.push(`${host} ${codeText} ${result.errorText}`)\n      }\n\n      this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n      const merged: string = errs.length > 0 ? errs.join(' || ') : 'unknown'\n      this.pushAssistant(`OpenClaw请求失败：${merged}`)\n    } catch (e) {\n      this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n      const msg: string = e instanceof Error ? e.message : 'unknown error'\n      this.pushAssistant(`OpenClaw请求异常：${msg}`)\n    } finally {\n      this.assistantBusy = false\n    }\n  }","newText":"    private async answerByOpenClaw(): Promise<void> {\n    const token: string = OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN.trim()\n    if (token.length <= 0) {\n      this.pushAssistant('OpenClaw token 为空，请检查 DeviceNetworkConfig.ets 中的 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN。')\n      return\n    }\n\n    const gatewayIp: string = deviceNetworkResolver.resolveGatewayIp()\n    const hosts: Array<string> = this.rankOpenClawHosts(resolveOpenClawHostCandidates(gatewayIp))\n    if (hosts.length <= 0) {\n      this.pushAssistant('未检测到 OpenClaw 服务地址，请检查 DeviceNetworkConfig.ets 中的 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_HOST。')\n      return\n    }\n\n    const reqMessages: Array<OpenClawChatMessage> = this.buildOpenClawMessages()\n\n    // 添加进度提示\n    this.pushAssistant('正在查询中，请稍候...')\n    this.assistantBusy = true\n    \n    // 增加超时时间到45秒，特别是对于天气查询\n    const timeoutId: number = this.setManagedTimeout((): void => {\n      this.assistantBusy = false\n      this.pushAssistant('查询超时（45秒），可能是网络较慢或服务繁忙，请稍后重试。')\n    }, 45000) // 总超时45秒，适合天气查询\n\n    try {\n      const errs: Array<string> = []\n      for (let i: number = 0; i < hosts.length; i++) {\n        const host: string = hosts[i]\n        const endpoint: string = buildOpenClawChatCompletionsUrl(host)\n        \n        // 增加连接和读取超时时间\n        const connectTimeoutMs: number = Math.min(12000, this.adaptiveOpenClawConnectTimeoutMs)\n        const readTimeoutMs: number = Math.min(30000, this.adaptiveOpenClawReadTimeoutMs)\n        \n        const client: OpenClawGatewayClient = new OpenClawGatewayClient({\n          endpoint,\n          bearerToken: token,\n          model: OPENCLAW_CHAT_MODEL,\n          connectTimeoutMs,\n          readTimeoutMs\n        })\n\n        this.logInfo('sendOpenClawRequest', `host=${host}, model=${OPENCLAW_CHAT_MODEL}, messages=${reqMessages.length}, ct=${connectTimeoutMs}, rt=${readTimeoutMs}`)\n        const result = await client.complete(reqMessages)\n        if (result.ok) {\n          this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n          this.markOpenClawHostSuccess(host)\n          this.logInfo('sendOpenClawSuccess', `host=${host}, chars=${result.text.length}`)\n          \n          // 确保UI更新\n          this.assistantBusy = false\n          // 移除进度提示，添加实际结果\n          this.messages = this.messages.filter(msg => msg.text !== '正在查询中，请稍候...')\n          this.pushAssistant(result.text)\n          return\n        }\n\n        this.markOpenClawHostFail(host)\n        const codeText: string = result.responseCode > 0 ? `HTTP ${result.responseCode}` : 'NETWORK'\n        this.logError('sendOpenClawFail', `host=${host}, code=${codeText}, reason=${result.errorText}`)\n        errs.push(`${host} ${codeText} ${result.errorText}`)\n      }\n\n      this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n      const merged: string = errs.length > 0 ? errs.join(' || ') : 'unknown'\n      \n      // 移除进度提示，添加错误信息\n      this.messages = this.messages.filter(msg => msg.text !== '正在查询中，请稍候...')\n      this.pushAssistant(`OpenClaw请求失败：${merged}`)\n    } catch (e) {\n      this.clearManagedTimer(timeoutId)\n      const msg: string = e instanceof Error ? e.message : 'unknown error'\n      \n      // 移除进度提示，添加异常信息\n      this.messages = this.messages.filter(msg => msg.text !== '正在查询中，请稍候...')\n      this.pushAssistant(`OpenClaw请求异常：${msg}`)\n    } finally {\n      this.assistantBusy = false\n    }\n  }"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-chat","usage":{"input":76912,"output":1977,"cacheRead":17472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776303166099}}
